# Forever / Midnight addon API

This repo is a **WoW: Forever** addon on Mainline Midnight-era UI (Interface ~120100). Forever uses the modern Mainline API set (~12.1.5), including secret values and Cooldown Manager — not Classic Era.

## Prefer

- `C_Spell.*`, `C_SpellBook.*`, `C_SpecializationInfo.*`, `C_CooldownViewer.*`, `C_UnitAuras.*`, `C_DurationUtil`, `C_Secrets`
- Existing helpers: `ns.AuraCompat`, `ns.SpecIndex` / `ns.SpecInfo`, CDM order helpers in `Core.lua`
- `issecretvalue` guards; Duration objects for cooldown/aura timing
- Patterns already present in this codebase over general old-client wiki advice

## Avoid

- `COMBAT_LOG_EVENT_UNFILTERED` / `CombatLogGetCurrentEventInfo`
- Bare pre-12.0 spell/spec APIs when `C_*` equivalents exist
- Branching Lua on secret combat numbers
- Dropping in Classic-era EventHorizon or WeakAura combat-log logic

See `AGENTS.md` for full project rules.
